        "who_heading": "Street energy. Maison standards.",
        "who_text": "<p>VELLOR is a designer streetwear house built at the intersection of raw street culture and restrained luxury. We make leather goods, outerwear, and elevated essentials for people who move between worlds — the block and the boardroom, the studio and the showroom.</p><p>Our core collection is premium heavyweight fleece — 14oz French terry, garment-dyed, with tonal V embroidery. The pieces you wear every day, built to outlast everything else in your closet.</p><p>Project V is our designer capsule — 50 pieces spanning leather perfecto jackets, Italian Nappa leather pants, mulberry silk evening wear, and a 12-bag signature handbag line with brushed brass hardware. Maison-tier construction with Miami-coded street energy.</p><p>Reference points: Bottega Veneta restraint, Loewe craft language, Off-White attitude, Aime Leon Dore heritage. We sit between those worlds — not one or the other, but both at once.</p>",
